<!--
  Static sitemap for LiBooks' public/marketing pages only — everything
  under /app/, /onboarding and /invite/ is excluded (already disallowed
  in robots.txt, and none of it is meaningful to index: it's either
  behind auth or a one-time invite link).

  This is a hand-maintained list because LiBooks is a client-rendered SPA
  with no build-time route generation — add a line here whenever a new
  public route is added to src/App.tsx. lastmod values are set to the day
  this sitemap was generated; update them when a page's content actually
  changes.

  Every public page below now has a genuine French URL and a genuine
  English URL under /en/ (see the /en/* routes in App.tsx and the
  bilingual content in each page component) — both are listed with
  reciprocal hreflang annotations, not just the homepage as before.
-->
